# Bumi Bash's second mode destroys a "land creature" even when it is a basic land: Badgermole Cub earthbends Bot1's
# Forest (a basic land, now a creature). The Bash destroys it; the Forest's own delayed return (earthbend) puts it back
# tapped as a plain land with no +1/+1 counter, so it is no longer a creature.

